# Visual Studio / .NET 构建缓存
.vs/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/bin-scroll-test/
**/obj-scroll-test/

# 截图与长截图算法调试产物
ScreenshotApp/artifacts/

# 离线翻译模型为独立语言包，体积大且不纳入源码仓库。
ScreenshotApp/Models/Translation/default/*.onnx
ScreenshotApp/Models/Translation/default/*.spm
ScreenshotApp/Models/Translation/default/tokenizer.json
ScreenshotApp/Models/Translation/default/manifest.json
ScreenshotApp/Models/Translation/default/vocab.json

# 中译英语言包与默认英译中语言包一致，仅随 Release/安装包资源分发。
ScreenshotApp/Models/Translation/zh-en/*.onnx
ScreenshotApp/Models/Translation/zh-en/*.spm
ScreenshotApp/Models/Translation/zh-en/manifest.json
ScreenshotApp/Models/Translation/zh-en/vocab.json
ScreenshotApp/Models/Translation/zh-en/UPSTREAM-README.md

# 离线语音输入模型作为 Release/安装包资源分发，单个权重文件不纳入普通 Git 仓库。
ScreenshotApp/Models/VoiceInput/default/model.int8.onnx
ScreenshotApp/Models/VoiceInput/default/test_wavs/
ScreenshotApp/Models/VoiceInput/default/export-onnx.py
ScreenshotApp/Models/VoiceInput/sensevoice.tar.bz2

# 常见本地临时文件
*.user
*.suo
*.tmp
*.log

# Android 协作端源码纳入主线；仅忽略本机构建缓存和产物。
AndroidApp/.gradle/
AndroidApp/.kotlin/
AndroidApp/**/build/
AndroidApp/local.properties
